[render-projection] Snapshot render projection (notstarted)
Files: crates/caravan-demo/src/render.rs
Do: Implement one value-producing Renderer<Snapshot> projection for the fixed anchor. Preserve the sampled LogicalTime, enclosing Tau, ordered tiles, independent terrain/actor/effect layers, actor identity and kind, and global resources in owned render values. Keep the module backend-neutral and free of frame history, device state, GPU assumptions, and authoritative mutation.
Accept: Focused unit evidence covers the empty result, the 91-tile saucer and stable tile order, independent layers, resources, exact sampled time, Tau, and repeated equal inputs. The projection uses the existing engine-presentation trait without expanding engine-api.
